WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.060
- As many people have observed,

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.800
of the thousands of people that streamed

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.330
into the Capitol on Wednesdays riots,

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:07.950
very few have been arrested.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.152
On the order of 50 or 60 people despite

00:00:10.152 --> 00:00:13.160
the fact that five people
have now lost their lives

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.865
including one Capitol police person.

00:00:14.865 --> 00:00:16.023
And on top of that,

00:00:16.023 --> 00:00:18.010
it's a national security nightmare.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:19.930
The computers of the members

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.410
of Congress were accessed,

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.890
files may have been stolen.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.580
And there's no good reason as

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.460
to why these people weren't arrested

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.220
and detained instead of just
letting them out scott free.

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:32.880
Well, the good news is there's
no reason that stops the FBI

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.910
or the department of justice
from arresting these people

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.120
after the fact.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.310
It's an evidentiary issue.

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:38.520
It's not a legal impediment.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.203
It's not like if you flee a crime scene,

00:00:40.203 --> 00:00:42.220
you're suddenly absolved of the crime.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.053
It's just a,

00:00:43.053 --> 00:00:44.516
an evidentiary matter of going through all

00:00:44.516 --> 00:00:46.040
of the social media posts.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.520
And luckily these people were not afraid

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:48.610
to videotape themselves

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:50.720
and just finding the guilty parties.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:52.190
It can happen after the fact,

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:54.184
days, weeks, months or even years later.

00:00:54.184 --> 00:00:55.310
But anyway,

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:56.143
I'll see you in court.

00:00:56.143 --> 00:00:57.740
And if you were there on Wednesday,

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:58.573
maybe literally.

